    {"type":"text","id":"s3_t","x":732,"y":198,"width":236,"height":24,"text":"③ Runtime Loading","originalText":"③ Runtime Loading","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#ffffff","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300031,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"s3","lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"s3_d","x":720,"y":260,"width":270,"height":110,"text":"index.ts import → register(api)\n· OpenClawPluginApi 주입\n· provider/channel/tool/hook 등록\n· lazy: 필요할 때만 (*.runtime.ts)\n\n⚠ in-process · 샌드박스 아님\n   (코어와 동일 신뢰 경계)","originalText":"index.ts import → register(api)\n· OpenClawPluginApi 주입\n· provider/channel/tool/hook 등록\n· lazy: 필요할 때만 (*.runtime.ts)\n\n⚠ in-process · 샌드박스 아님\n   (코어와 동일 신뢰 경계)","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":300032,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.4},

